&oh=00_AQTDrZmWDEOWYQK3F4yKtU-CJeD37CY9YE4jcXtVOLyAVg&oe=6AFB1703"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": null, "display_name": "RoomRally", "keywords": ["trackbuilder", "toycars", "sandbox", "creative", "cargame"], "long_description": "Your track starts with an idea.\n\nRoomRally is a free, single-player toy car building game. Combine straights, turns, slopes, boosters, and loops to create your own track. Place the car, see what happens, and make a change for the next attempt.\n\nIn free play, start from any track section, pause the car, and keep expanding your creation. Let the car drive automatically or use your controllers to accelerate and brake. When an attempt goes wrong, bring the car back, adjust your design, and try again.\n\nDuplicate or replace pieces, use Undo and Redo, and save your tracks in three local slots to return to them later. Add decorations to make each creation your own.\n\nIn-game text is currently in Spanish.", "short_description": "Build toy car tracks, test your ideas, and adjust every turn, booster, and loop."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://porfiadostudios.com/roomrally-privacy.html", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Porfiado", "support_website_url": "https://porfiadostudios.com/#contacto", "website_url": "https://porfiadostudios.com/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_MOST", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "1990104051447093"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "NO_MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["es_AR"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["SITTING", "STANDING"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_